# A structural cast whose accessor is declared in ANOTHER package, and whose
# class the app never names. The `get <prop>` string global the conformance test
# scans for is interned off the *cast*, not off any accessor declaration this
# module can see — if it were the latter, the property would read as absent here
# and the cast would throw.
# name         dir   deps         root
@test/geo      geo   -
main           app   @test/geo    root
